@TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7053

### Тест 1: Логин с корректными данными
POST {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "username": "admin", 
  "password": "Admin123"
}

### Тест 2: Неверный логин или пароль
POST {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "username": "admi",
  "password": "Admin123"
}

### Тест 3: Обновление токена
POST {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/refresh
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "refreshToken": "7VdtXYdhEOqxKCxKHdwuBTZ+D2ei8ARQlQDthY2B3jI="
}

### Тест 4: Попытка доступа БЕЗ токена (Ожидаем 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Test/secure-data

### Тест 5: Доступ С токеном (Ожидаем 200 OK)
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkB0YXNrZmxvdy5sb2NhbCIsImp0aSI6IjM2YTA1MWE4LWZlMjMtNDBjOS1hM2E0LThkMGQ0NTZkNjM3MCIsImV4cCI6MTc4ODgyMzUxMywiaXNzIjoiVGFza0Zsb3dBUEkiLCJhdWQiOiJUYXNrRmxvd0NsaWVudCJ9.0p2qsZYRo9uoxidPcdqd1tqYTg1b18GJiPhlKFHSI5E
GET {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Test/secure-data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Тест 6: Logout (отзыв токена)
POST {{TaskFlow.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "refreshToken": "Zsm6ULZ11DIdTK+iiKPZbp+pGT2rAmYrSRNu4QV1wrE="
}
